# Keep the repository LF and the working copy LF, so the same bytes build on Windows and
# on the Amplify builder (Linux). Without this, Git would check the files out as CRLF here
# and every diff would be a whole-file rewrite.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary

# Lockfiles get no diff noise in review.
package-lock.json text eol=lf
